@StudentRegister.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5078

### Login as Viewer (the HTTP client stores the returned cookie)
POST {{StudentRegister.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "viewer",
  "password": "viewer123"
}

### Viewer can read students
GET {{StudentRegister.Api_HostAddress}}/api/student
Accept: application/json

### Viewer receives 403 for an Admin-only operation
DELETE {{StudentRegister.Api_HostAddress}}/api/student/1

### Login as Admin (replaces the current authentication cookie)
POST {{StudentRegister.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Admin can add a student
POST {{StudentRegister.Api_HostAddress}}/api/student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Lerato",
  "lastName": "Khumalo",
  "studentNumber": "ST005",
  "gender": "F"
}

### Show the current authenticated user
GET {{StudentRegister.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me

### Clear the authentication cookie
POST {{StudentRegister.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout

###
